/**
\defgroup core Core
\brief Audio graph engine, node base classes, audio buffer, parameter system, and span utilities

The Core module provides the foundational types for the CASPI library:
- \ref CASPI::Graph::NodeBase "NodeBase", \ref CASPI::Graph::AudioNode "AudioNode", \ref CASPI::Graph::ControlNode "ControlNode" -- polymorphic node hierarchy
- \ref CASPI::Graph::AudioContext "AudioContext", \ref CASPI::Graph::AudioGraph "AudioGraph" -- graph engine for connecting nodes and processing blocks
- \ref CASPI::AudioBuffer "AudioBuffer" -- multichannel audio buffer with interleaved and channel-major layouts
- \ref CASPI::Core::Span "Span", \ref CASPI::Core::StridedSpan "StridedSpan" -- safe array views with SIMD eligibility
- \ref CASPI::Core::Parameter "Parameter" -- modulatable parameter system with per-block smoothing
- \ref CASPI::Phase "Phase" -- phase accumulator for oscillators
- \ref CASPI::expected "Expected" -- monadic error handling
- \ref CASPI::CircularAudioBuffer "CircularAudioBuffer" -- ring buffers for delay lines

\defgroup oscillators Oscillators
\brief Band-limited and modulation oscillator implementations

Oscillator types for waveform generation:
- \ref CASPI::Oscillators::BlepOscillator "BlepOscillator" -- PolyBLEP antialiased oscillator (sine, saw, square, triangle, pulse)
- \ref CASPI::Oscillators::WavetableOscillator "WavetableOscillator" -- sample-accurate wavetable playback
- \ref CASPI::Operator "Operator" -- FM/PM operator with self-modulation and built-in envelope
- \ref CASPI::Oscillators::LFO "LFO" -- low-frequency oscillator for modulation
- \ref CASPI::Oscillators::NoiseOscillator "NoiseOscillator" -- white and pink noise generators

\defgroup filters Filters
\brief Audio filter implementations

- \ref CASPI::Filters::SvfFilter "SvfFilter" -- state-variable filter (low-pass, high-pass, band-pass, notch, all-pass)
- \ref CASPI::Filters::FilterBase "FilterBase" -- CRTP base for creating custom filter types
- \ref caspi_OnePoleFilter "OnePoleFilter" -- simple one-pole filter

\defgroup controls Controls
\brief Control-rate signal generators and modulation

- \ref CASPI::Envelope::ADSR "ADSR (Envelope)" -- envelope generator with configurable attack, decay, sustain, release
- \ref CASPI::Controls::ModMatrix "ModMatrix" -- modulation routing matrix with curve shaping

\defgroup synthesis Synthesis
\brief Synthesis engine implementations

- \ref CASPI::FMGraphBuilder "FMGraphBuilder", \ref CASPI::FMGraphDSP "FMGraphDSP" -- FM synthesis engine with graph validation
- \ref CASPI::VoiceManager "VoiceManager" -- polyphonic voice manager
- \ref CASPI::Engine "Engine" -- real-time audio engine

\defgroup maths Maths
\brief Math utilities and SIMD abstractions

- \ref CASPI::SIMD "SIMD" -- SIMD abstractions for SSE, NEON, WASM with scalar fallbacks
- \ref CASPI::FFT "FFT" -- fast Fourier transform
- Utility functions (clamp, lerp, map, db conversion, MIDI conversion) in \ref CASPI::Maths "CASPI::Maths"

\defgroup base Base
\brief Low-level infrastructure and platform support

- \ref CASPI::AssertInfo "AssertInfo" -- debug assertions
- \ref CASPI::Core::ScopedFlushDenormals "ScopedFlushDenormals" -- denormal flushing utilities
- \ref CASPI::Constants "Constants" -- mathematical constants
- \ref CASPI::ScopedRealtimeDisable "ScopedRealtimeDisable", \ref CASPI::ScopedRealtimeThread "ScopedRealtimeThread" -- real-time safety annotations
- Platform detection macros, utility macros, feature detection, backtrace capture, type traits, compatibility polyfills

\defgroup gain Gain
\brief Gain and waveshaping processors

- \ref CASPI::Gain "Gain" -- linear gain processing
- \ref CASPI::Gain::Waveshaper "Waveshaper" -- wavetable-based waveshaping with configurable transfer functions

\defgroup midi MIDI
\brief MIDI message processing

- \ref CASPI::Midi::MidiMessage "MidiMessage" -- MIDI message parsing and encoding
- \ref CASPI::Midi::MidiStream "MidiStream" -- real-time-safe MIDI stream buffer

\defgroup external External
\brief Third-party integrations

- \ref moodycamel::ConcurrentQueue "moodycamel::ConcurrentQueue" -- lock-free queue for real-time safe inter-thread communication
- \ref moodycamel::BlockingConcurrentQueue "moodycamel::BlockingConcurrentQueue" -- blocking variant with wait/dequeue

*/
